WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.334
Roxy flew through the air, carrying the heavy vehicles.

2
00:00:05.335 --> 00:00:08.213
"Wow!" yelled someone on the ground.

3
00:00:08.214 --> 00:00:10.815
"Rocket Girl is holding a bus!"

4
00:00:10.816 --> 00:00:14.391
"And a taxi too!" said someone else.

5
00:00:14.392 --> 00:00:19.707
Roxy found a safe, quiet street.

6
00:00:19.708 --> 00:00:23.290
She put down the vehicles.

7
00:00:23.291 --> 00:00:27.309
"Thank you, Rocket Girl!" said a woman on the bus.

8
00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:31.449
"You're my hero, Rocket Girl!" said the taxi driver.

9
00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:34.823
"No problem, folks!" said Roxy.

10
00:00:34.824 --> 00:00:38.482
Roxy blasted off and headed back to West Street.

11
00:00:38.483 --> 00:00:40.961
Snow was still swirling everywhere.

12
00:00:40.962 --> 00:00:44.899
The wind was blowing strong, and deep snowdrifts were forming.

13
00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:49.149
"I've never seen a blizzard this bad!" thought Roxy.

14
00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:52.712
She saw two police cars half buried under the snow.

15
00:00:52.713 --> 00:00:56.643
Some police officers were trying to dig them out.

16
00:00:56.644 --> 00:01:02.604
"Which way did Weatherman go?" Roxy called to the police officers.

17
00:01:02.605 --> 00:01:06.982
"He went that way, toward the mountains," yelled one officer.

18
00:01:06.983 --> 00:01:11.916
Roxy zoomed after the villain, following the van's tracks in the snow.

19
00:01:11.917 --> 00:01:14.673
The wind was howling.

20
00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:18.226
Snow blew everywhere, covering the van's tracks.

21
00:01:18.227 --> 00:01:20.639
Roxy used her super vision.

22
00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:25.355
Far ahead she could see faint lights through the thick falling snow.

23
00:01:25.356 --> 00:01:27.551
"There he is!" she said.

24
00:01:27.552 --> 00:01:31.136
"Now it's time to put a stop to this villain!"

25
00:01:31.137 --> 00:01:33.498
Roxy soon caught up to the van. She

26
00:01:33.499 --> 00:01:37.336
took a deep, deep breath. Then . . . Whoo-ooo-oosh!

27
00:01:37.337 --> 00:01:42.226
Roxy blew as hard as she could. She

28
00:01:42.227 --> 00:01:44.884
let out a powerful gust of wind. A

29
00:01:44.885 --> 00:01:48.385
huge snowdrift formed in front of Weatherman's van. Boomph!

30
00:01:48.386 --> 00:01:53.718
The van slammed into the snowdrift. "I'll

31
00:01:53.719 --> 00:01:57.978
get you for that, Rocket Girl!" shouted Weatherman. He

32
00:01:57.979 --> 00:02:00.968
jumped out of the van and held up a Weather Ball. He

33
00:02:00.969 --> 00:02:05.075
was just about to throw it when— whiz-hoo!

34
00:02:05.076 --> 00:02:11.008
Roxy blasted the ball to pieces with her eye laser beams.

35
00:02:11.009 --> 00:02:16.284
"You won't be creating any more bad weather today!" said Roxy.

36
00:02:16.285 --> 00:02:19.126
"You're going to jail, Weatherman!"

37
00:02:19.127 --> 00:02:23.521
"Agh!" said Weatherman.

38
00:02:23.522 --> 00:02:26.946
"This is so much fun!" said Jack.

39
00:02:26.947 --> 00:02:29.634
"I can't believe it snowed!"

40
00:02:29.635 --> 00:02:35.544
Jack, Mara, and Terrell were making a snowman in Terrell's backyard.

41
00:02:35.545 --> 00:02:39.505
"I wonder when Roxy will be back," said Terrell.

42
00:02:39.506 --> 00:02:42.232
"She's been gone a long time."

43
00:02:42.233 --> 00:02:47.249
"Yeah," said Mara. "She's missing all the fun!"

44
00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:51.388
"Here I am!" called Roxy as she ran into the yard.

45
00:02:51.389 --> 00:02:55.137
"I'm so surprised that it snowed."

46
00:02:55.138 --> 00:02:58.206
Terrell looked at Roxy suspiciously.

47
00:02:58.207 --> 00:03:03.522
"I wonder if Rocket Girl had something to do with it," he said.

48
00:03:03.523 --> 00:03:10.128
"Who knows?" said Roxy with a smile.

